NAME
       yes - print a word over and over

SYNOPSIS
       yes [TEXT]

DESCRIPTION
       yes prints TEXT (or y) on a line, again and again, until it is
       stopped. Piped into a command that asks many questions, it answers
       all of them. Most commands have their own option for this (-y, -f),
       which is safer.

EXAMPLES
           yes | cp -i /root/conf/* /etc/myapp/

SEE ALSO
       head(1)
